{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0141RPr84DMpTuvYg2R44G2L","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Change brief\n2\t\n3\t## Problem and outcome\n4\t\n5\t## Acceptance criteria\n6\t\n7\t## Constraints and exclusions\n8\t\n9\t- Must (non-negotiables):\n10\t- Must not (exclusions and rejected alternatives):\n11\t\n12\t## Approach\n13\t\n14\tThe implementation checklist lives in `checklist.json` (definitions with id/description/verify) and is marked only with `sdlc.py mark`. Give an item a `check` (argv + timeout) whenever an automated proof exists; `verify` then runs it and no mark is needed.\n15\t\n16\t## Risks and verification\n17\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f309f9c8-1473-4f76-8d79-3d58dcb79201","uuid":"860d42f7-7406-40c9-a0c6-8dc726b32939","timestamp":"2026-10-27T04:49:08.287Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/jondev/dev/worktrees/pi-skimmer/i-delete-pi-skimmer-s-leftover-recovery-folders-myself-from-within-pi-using-a-sk/runs/i-delete-pi-skimmer-s-leftover-recovery-folders-myself-from-within-pi-using-a-sk/brief.md","content":"# Change brief\n\n## Problem and outcome\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n## Constraints and exclusions\n\n- Must (non-negotiables):\n- Must not (exclusions and rejected alternatives):\n\n## Approach\n\nThe implementation checklist lives in `checklist.json` (definitions with id/description/verify) and is marked only with `sdlc.py mark`. Give an item a `check` (argv + timeout) whenever an automated proof exists; `verify` then runs it and no mark is needed.\n\n## Risks and verification\n","numLines":17,"startLine":1,"totalLines":17}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_0141RPr84DMpTuvYg2R44G2L","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
